#: lock/main.cc:65
msgid "Only use the blank screensaver"
msgstr "Bloots den leddigen Pausschirm bruken"

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:736
msgid "Will not lock the session, as unlocking would be impossible:\n"
msgstr "De Törn warrt nich afslaten, dat Opsluten is nich mööglich:\n"

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:740
msgid "Cannot start <i>kcheckpass</i>."
msgstr "<i>kcheckpass</i> lett sik nich opropen."

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:741
msgid "<i>kcheckpass</i> is unable to operate. Possibly it is not SetUID root."
msgstr ""
"<i>kcheckpass</i> löppt nich. Villicht is dor nich SetUID \"root\" för "
"instellt."

#: lock/lockprocess.cc:784
msgid "No appropriate greeter plugin configured."
msgstr "Keen passen Grööt-Moduul fastleggt."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:95
msgid "<nobr><b>The session is locked</b><br>"
msgstr "<nobr><b>De Törn is afslaten</b><br>"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:96
#, qt-format
msgid "<nobr><b>The session was locked by %1</b><br>"
msgstr "<nobr><b>%1 hett den Törn afslaten</b><br>"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:106
msgid "Unl&ock"
msgstr "&Opsluten"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:108
msgid "Sw&itch User..."
msgstr "&Bruker wesseln..."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:208
msgid "<b>Unlocking failed</b>"
msgstr "<b>Opsluten is fehlslaan</b>"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:214
msgid "<b>Warning: Caps Lock on</b>"
msgstr "<b>Wohrschoen: Grootschrievtast anmaakt</b>"

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:446
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"Cannot unlock the session because the authentication system failed to work;\n"
"you must kill krunner_lock (pid %1) manually."
msgstr ""
"De Törn lett sik nich opsluten, dat Systeem för de Identiteetprööv nich so "
"löppt;\n"
"Du muttst \"krunner_lock\" (Perzess-ID %1) vun Hand afscheten."

#: lock/lockdlg.cc:560
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"You have chosen to open another desktop session instead of resuming the "
"current one.<br>The current session will be hidden and a new login screen "
"will be displayed.<br>An F-key is assigned to each session; F%1 is usually "
"assigned to the first session, F%2 to the second session and so on. You can "
"switch between sessions by pressing Ctrl, Alt and the appropriate F-key at "
"the same time. Additionally, the KDE Panel and Desktop menus have actions "
"for switching between sessions."
msgstr ""
"Du wullt en anner Schriefdischtörn opmaken, un nich na den aktuellen torüch "
"gahn. <br>De aktuelle Törn warrt versteken un en nieg Anmellschirm wiest. "
"<br>För elkeen Törn gifft dat en Funkschonentast; F%1 is normalerwies för "
"den eersten Törn, F%2 för den tweten usw. Mit ALT+STRG+[tohören "
"Funkschonentast] kannst Du de Törns wesseln, oder ok mit de Akschonen binnen "
"dat KDE-Paneel un de Schriefdischmenüs."

